/-! **L8-H2 port of main `WaveTurbulence.Foundations.Flower.FinalMKPhase1.Inv2`** (sha256 in H2/COPIED-SHA256SUMS): only the declarations
that depend on the vine-family carrier, re-stated over L6's low run (`FinalCount.H`, `Src … Src.γL`,
